  "section_notes": "The final S2 keeps a 5% cap and 55 °C test but removes any automatic sales stop, which protects Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2% failure). S5 sets a mandatory recall at 8 per 100,000 with no transition and counts unverified and unreported incidents, which exposes Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9) to an immediate recall. S1 requires 24-hour reporting of all incidents, which hits Northwind's three unreported incidents and Halcyon's four."
